{"name":"HQNP (high quality normie pheno)","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":34,"casual":{"lead":["HQNP stands for high quality normie pheno(type). On looksmax.org it describes a woman whose looks are polished and conventionally attractive without being unusual, exotic or extreme.","For people working on their own looks, the term works as a shared yardstick: members compare what they consider a typical high-end mainstream look and discuss which traits create it, such as skin, grooming and proportion. It is a vocabulary item, not a method or product."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["Members use the label in thread titles and rating posts, for example asking whether a photographed woman looks HQNP, or sharing examples they consider ideal. Some threads treat it as a target to discuss in dating and approaching contexts. There is no routine to follow."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["The term is subjective and tied to forum culture, where it sits alongside rating scales and other labels. Photos posted under it are opinions of strangers. No health risk arises from the term itself."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"HQNP Stacy n Betabuxxer Husband","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hqnp-stacy-n-betabuxxer-husband.1771324/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251230151326/https://looksmax.org/threads/hqnp-stacy-n-betabuxxer-husband.1771324/"},{"title":"HQNP Target Cold approach Bathroom slay","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hqnp-target-cold-approach-bathroom-slay.1233649/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250111083114/https://looksmax.org/threads/hqnp-target-cold-approach-bathroom-slay.1233649/"},{"title":"hqnp foids dont exist","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hqnp-foids-dont-exist.931445/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240319042231/https://looksmax.org/threads/hqnp-